      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777266073850,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. WHAT IS GRAPHQL?\n   - A Query Language for your API and a runtime for fulfilling those queries.\n   - Developed by Facebook to solve mobile data efficiency.\n   - KEY DIFFERENCE FROM REST: \n     * REST: Multiple endpoints (e.g., /users, /posts/1).\n     * GRAPHQL: Single endpoint (/graphql) where you \"ask\" for what you want.",
      "fontSize": 21.972222222222246,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. WHAT IS GRAPHQL?\n   - A Query Language for your API and a runtime for fulfilling those queries.\n   - Developed by Facebook to solve mobile data efficiency.\n   - KEY DIFFERENCE FROM REST: \n     * REST: Multiple endpoints (e.g., /users, /posts/1).\n     * GRAPHQL: Single endpoint (/graphql) where you \"ask\" for what you want.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
