      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "INPUT TYPES\n   - Best practice for mutations.\n   - Groups multiple arguments into a single object.\n   - Makes APIs cleaner and easier to version.",
