      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777267120104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "   - Occurs when a query for a list of items triggers a separate sub-query for each item.\n   - Example: Fetch 10 users (1 query) + Fetch posts for each (10 queries) = 11 queries.\n   - Solution: Batching and Caching (e.g., DataLoader).",
      "fontSize": 22.44083308524676,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "   - Occurs when a query for a list of items triggers a separate sub-query for each item.\n   - Example: Fetch 10 users (1 query) + Fetch posts for each (10 queries) = 11 queries.\n   - Solution: Batching and Caching (e.g., DataLoader).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
